674821615229_9044775275073634304_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0qDfvJ-KlhQQ7kNvwFUTrx3&_nc_oc=AdpQ883UG_b9DiKvpoFJswTp6iKUWzYh0hspG2jB27hS0tY2hnEaNOM2M6JY2dhjbVc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7eX0Vp8Gw-nTrcm0bqAV4wA8Sm2_-anmxa4O36WPXrIQ&oe=6A0096D9"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "2513502842299488", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162726_1854054711577045_5582650056718155776_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xJSJeHIXmPMQ7kNvwF2Cv93&_nc_oc=AdqqiUfXQw9568yjO-gU6SW4i4iJYDbFGRJIVmmid5GrvK7E5XtJSNz2KeAltizPmKs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5uzkI_HGYF_0qdT_vd9iqnLts-o0pnnbhQ5qJK_PatiA&oe=6A009F96"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1720845498222971", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162687_1720845501556304_758256641949827072_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ydhR-eFNjrMQ7kNvwFmU6s3&_nc_oc=AdpJaYNhKqSAKlDp2ycLJQSCMbMiCVpOn76o1r0Hfpb0V8F_26jmrIUNS5ARQkH9gCE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af466h4J021tb9oPUaIg02xo9ge26ZqmwQfSK62yVviD6g&oe=6A009BB1"}, "display_name": "Evil Presence", "keywords": ["horror", "hospital", "scary", "jumpscare", "haunted"], "long_description": "Venture into the unknown, but beware of what lurks behind these walls. Evil Presence is a physiological horror experience like no other, built exclusively for virtual reality. The hospital once belonged to a very wealthy family but now it has been abandoned. Your goal is to collect bags of money lying, however the hospital is now home to a monstrous abomination, an experiment gone wrong.\n\nEvery play-through will be different as the hospital features some random generation. \n\nCan you make it out alive?\n\nHeadphones and a Gear VR controller are recommended but not required.\n\nWARNING: CONTAINS PLENTY OF JUMP SCARES", "short_descrip